        <mxCell id="note_rubric" value="&lt;b&gt;Rubric -&gt; where it lives&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Week 7:&lt;br&gt;- Inheritance: Vehicle -&gt; Car / Truck / Bus / EmergencyVehicle&lt;br&gt;- Generics: WeightedRandom&lt;T&gt;  (+ typed collections)&lt;br&gt;- Exceptions: SimulationException -&gt; InvalidNetworkException&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Week 13:&lt;br&gt;- State: LightState / Red / Green / YellowState&lt;br&gt;- Strategy: TurnStrategy / RandomTurnStrategy&lt;br&gt;- Observer: SimulationObserver (SimulationDisplay)&lt;br&gt;- Factory: NetworkLoader&lt;br&gt;- Streams / lambdas: Statistics&lt;br&gt;- Parallelism: SimulationEngine.step() (two-phase)&lt;br&gt;- Emergent behaviour: random slowdown in Vehicle.move()" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
